# Journal-subset fixture for the multi-year personal and small-business load.
# Rich evidence links, invoices, ownership, and settlement histories are
# intentionally constructed through semantic APIs in heavy_ledgers.rs: the V0
# surface has no syntax for those relations yet.
book management-2020-2025

